cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SimWebView, please cite this software using the metadata below
  and identify the exact repository commit or release used.
type: software
license: MIT
title: "SimWebView: Web-based visualization of large geotechnical simulation models"
version: 0.1.0a0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kuonijiwa/SimWebView"
url: "https://github.com/kuonijiwa/SimWebView"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cheng"
    given-names: "Yongjin"
  - family-names: "Chu"
    given-names: "Weijiang"
  - name: "HydroChina Itasca"
abstract: >-
  Offline processing and browser presentation of large geotechnical simulation
  models: outer-surface inspection, inner excavation-surface inspection, and
  data reduction and partitioning. Three FLAC3D and 3DEC examples include
  retained field associations, source identifiers and editable Vue/vtk.js viewers.
keywords:
  - geotechnical engineering
  - scientific visualization
  - VTK
  - PyVista
  - web visualization
